## 🛠️ Implementation Steps

### 1. Catalog Page Creation
We created a new file [catalog.html](file:///c:/Users/ALPHA-1/Desktop/AVANI%20AGRO%20FOODS%20LATUR%202026/public/catalog.html) in the `public` directory.
- Custom fonts imported: **Playfair Display** (for headers) and **DM Sans** (for premium sans-serif details).
- Designed for perfect print/PDF boundaries at `1080px` x `1080px` dimensions.
- Embedded premium SVGs and functional CTA actions (direct links to global quotes, sample requests, and custom WhatsApp deep linking with pre-filled product interests).

### 2. Local Verification and Build
We successfully compiled the React + Vite production build using `npm run build` in the background:
- 2,146 modules transformed.
- The `catalog.html` in `public` was automatically copied by Vite into `dist/catalog.html` without any modification, ensuring correct absolute URL paths.

### 3. Automated Vercel Deploy
We ran `npx vercel --prod --yes` to bypass manual verification and push the update to production immediately:
- Uploaded and built successfully.
- Deployment live at: [https://avani-agro-foods-latur-2026.vercel.app/catalog.html](https://avani-agro-foods-latur-2026.vercel.app/catalog.html) (and canonical domain `avaniagrofoods.com/catalog.html`).

